  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Menkul K&#x131;ymetler Hukuku Bilgisi.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> &#x130;&#x15f;bu Plan kapsam&#x131;nda sa&#x11f;lanan RSU&#x2019;lar, yaln&#x131;zca &#x15e;irket ve Ba&#x11f;l&#x131; &#x130;&#x15f;tiraklerinin &ccedil;al&#x131;&#x15f;anlar&#x131;na sunulmakta olup, Plan&#x2019;a kat&#x131;l&#x131;m teklifi &ouml;zel nitelikli bir arz te&#x15f;kil etmektedir. RSU&#x2019;lar&#x131;n tahsisi ile hak edi&#x15f;e ba&#x11f;l&#x131; olarak Hisselerin ihra&ccedil; edilmesi i&#x15f;lemleri T&uuml;rkiye d&#x131;&#x15f;&#x131;nda ger&ccedil;ekle&#x15f;tirilmektedir.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Yabanc&#x131; bir borsada i&#x15f;lem g&ouml;ren hisselerin T&uuml;rkiye&#x2019;de yerle&#x15f;ik ki&#x15f;iler taraf&#x131;ndan al&#x131;m ve sat&#x131;m&#x131;, yaln&#x131;zca bir finansal arac&#x131; kurulu&#x15f; vas&#x131;tas&#x131;yla ger&ccedil;ekle&#x15f;tirilebilmektedir. Bu kapsamda, Plan uyar&#x131;nca edinilen Hisselerin sat&#x131;&#x15f;&#x131; i&ccedil;in bir T&uuml;rk arac&#x131; kurumunun g&ouml;revlendirilmesi gerekebilir. &#x130;&#x15f;bu Plan kapsam&#x131;nda edinilen herhangi bir Hissenin kullan&#x131;lmas&#x131; veya sat&#x131;lmas&#x131; &ouml;ncesinde, y&uuml;r&uuml;rl&uuml;kteki mevzuata uygunlu&#x11f;un teyidi amac&#x131;yla kendi hukuki ve vergisel dan&#x131;&#x15f;manlar&#x131;n&#x131;za ba&#x15f;vurman&#x131;z gerekmektedir.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Foreign Ownership Reporting.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> If you are a resident of T&uuml;rkiye, within three months following your first cash and/or in-kind capital issuance for establishing a company abroad, becoming a shareholder in an existing company (including shares acquired under an employee share option plan) or opening a branch, you are required to fill out the information form on capital issuance abroad published on the website of the Ministry of Trade in accordance with the explanations stated therein and send it to the Ministry of Treasury and Finance and the Ministry of Trade. In addition, within 3 months from the end of each calendar year, you are required to update the information form and submit it to the Ministry of Trade. Further information on the reporting obligation is available at https://ticaret.gov.tr/hizmet-ticareti/yurtdisi-yatirimlar/yurtdisi-yatirim-bildirimi, as may be amended from time to time. You should consult with your personal advisor to ensure that you are properly complying with the exchange control regulations.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Yabanc&#x131; M&uuml;lkiyet Bildirimi. </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">T&uuml;rkiye&#x2019;de mukim olman&#x131;z h&acirc;linde; yurt d&#x131;&#x15f;&#x131;nda bir &#x15f;irket kurulmas&#x131;, mevcut bir &#x15f;irkete ortak olunmas&#x131; (&ccedil;al&#x131;&#x15f;anlara y&ouml;nelik hisse opsiyon veya benzeri pay edindirme planlar&#x131; kapsam&#x131;nda edinilen paylar d&acirc;hil) veya yurt d&#x131;&#x15f;&#x131;nda &#x15f;ube a&ccedil;&#x131;lmas&#x131; amac&#x131;yla ger&ccedil;ekle&#x15f;tirilen ilk nakd&icirc; ve/veya ayn&icirc; sermaye ihrac&#x131;n&#x131; takiben &uuml;&ccedil; ay i&ccedil;erisinde, Ticaret Bakanl&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131;&#x2019;n&#x131;n internet sitesinde yay&#x131;mlanan ve a&ccedil;&#x131;klamalar&#x131; do&#x11f;rultusunda doldurulmas&#x131; gereken &#x201c;Yurt D&#x131;&#x15f;&#x131; Sermaye Bildirim Formu&#x201d;nun doldurularak Hazine ve Maliye Bakanl&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131; ile Ticaret Bakanl&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131;&#x2019;na g&ouml;nderilmesi zorunludur. Ayr&#x131;ca, her takvim y&#x131;l&#x131;n&#x131;n sona ermesini takiben &uuml;&ccedil; ay i&ccedil;erisinde, an&#x131;lan bilgi formunun g&uuml;ncellenerek Ticaret Bakanl&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131;&#x2019;na yeniden sunulmas&#x131; gerekmektedir. Bildirim y&uuml;k&uuml;ml&uuml;l&uuml;&#x11f;&uuml;ne ili&#x15f;kin ayr&#x131;nt&#x131;l&#x131; bilgilere, zaman zaman de&#x11f;i&#x15f;tirilebilecek olmak &uuml;zere, </font><font><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">https://ticaret.gov.tr/hizmet-ticareti/yurtdisi-yatirimlar/yurtdisi-yatirim-bildirimi</font></font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> adresinden eri&#x15f;ilebilir. D&ouml;viz mevzuat&#x131;na uygunlu&#x11f;unuzun usul&uuml;ne uygun &#x15f;ekilde sa&#x11f;land&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131;ndan emin olmak i&ccedil;in kendi ki&#x15f;isel dan&#x131;&#x15f;man&#x131;n&#x131;za ba&#x15f;vurman&#x131;z gerekmektedir.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Exchange Control Information. </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As per the</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Decree No. 32 on the Protection of the Value of Turkish Currency, issued by the Council of Ministers, based on the Law No. 1567, all transfer of money in/out of T&uuml;rkiye must go through a Turkish bank. However, if no promotional, advertising, or marketing activities are directed at persons resident in T&uuml;rkiye, residents may, on their own initiative, enter into derivative transactions directly with foreign financial institutions without using authorized banks or intermediaries, provided that all related payment transfers are still made through banks. Furthermore, the value of the foreign currency against the Turkish currency shall be determined as per the procedures set by the Central Bank of the Republic of T&uuml;rkiye.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As per the communique of the Capital Markets Board specific to this matter (i.e. Communique on Foreign Stock Exchange Securities, Depositary Receipts and Foreign Investment Fund Shares) the capital, interest and coupon payments of the foreign stock exchange securities may be made in Turkish currency or the currency of the relevant foreign stock exchange security (e.g., if the currency of the underlying shares are in USD), then the sale proceeds can be transferred in USD or Turkish Lira.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">D&ouml;viz Mevzuat&#x131;na &#x130;li&#x15f;kin Bilgilendirme.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> 1567 say&#x131;l&#x131; T&uuml;rk Paras&#x131;n&#x131;n K&#x131;ymetini Koruma Hakk&#x131;nda Kanun&#x2019;a dayan&#x131;larak Bakanlar Kurulu taraf&#x131;ndan &ccedil;&#x131;kar&#x131;lan T&uuml;rk Paras&#x131;n&#x131;n K&#x131;ymetini Koruma Hakk&#x131;nda 32 say&#x131;l&#x131; Karar uyar&#x131;nca, T&uuml;rkiye&#x2019;ye veya T&uuml;rkiye&#x2019;den yap&#x131;lacak t&uuml;m para transferlerinin bir T&uuml;rk bankas&#x131; arac&#x131;l&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131;yla ger&ccedil;ekle&#x15f;tirilmesi gerekmektedir. Ancak, T&uuml;rkiye&#x2019;de yerle&#x15f;ik ki&#x15f;ilere y&ouml;nelik herhangi bir tan&#x131;t&#x131;m, reklam veya pazarlama faaliyeti y&uuml;r&uuml;t&uuml;lmemesi kayd&#x131;yla, T&uuml;rkiye&#x2019;de yerle&#x15f;ik ki&#x15f;iler, tamamen kendi inisiyatifleriyle, yetkili bankalar veya arac&#x131; kurumlar kullan&#x131;lmaks&#x131;z&#x131;n do&#x11f;rudan yabanc&#x131; finansal kurulu&#x15f;larla t&uuml;rev i&#x15f;lemlere taraf olabilirler. Bu kapsamda yap&#x131;lacak t&uuml;m &ouml;deme transferlerinin yine bankalar arac&#x131;l&#x131;&#x11f;&#x131;yla ger&ccedil;ekle&#x15f;tirilmesi zorunludur. Ayr&#x131;ca, yabanc&#x131; paran&#x131;n T&uuml;rk paras&#x131; kar&#x15f;&#x131;s&#x131;ndaki de&#x11f;eri, T&uuml;rkiye Cumhuriyet Merkez Bankas&#x131; taraf&#x131;ndan belirlenen usul ve esaslara g&ouml;re tespit edilir.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Bu konuya ili&#x15f;kin Sermaye Piyasas&#x131; Kurulu&#x2019;nun ilgili tebli&#x11f;i (</font><font><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Yabanc&#x131; Sermaye Piyasas&#x131; Ara&ccedil;lar&#x131; ve Depo Sertifikalar&#x131; ile Yabanc&#x131; Yat&#x131;r&#x131;m Fonu Paylar&#x131; Tebli&#x11f;i</font></font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">) uyar&#x131;nca, yabanc&#x131; borsa menkul k&#x131;ymetlerine ili&#x15f;kin anapara, faiz ve kupon &ouml;demeleri T&uuml;rk paras&#x131; veya ilgili yabanc&#x131; borsa menkul k&#x131;ymetinin para birimi cinsinden yap&#x131;labilir (&ouml;rne&#x11f;in, dayanak paylar&#x131;n para biriminin ABD Dolar&#x131; olmas&#x131; halinde), bu durumda sat&#x131;&#x15f; bedelleri ABD Dolar&#x131; veya T&uuml;rk Liras&#x131; cinsinden transfer edilebilir.</font></p></div>
